  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "19.1.0\n* Advance payments (BG-X-45): new AdvancePayment class and AddAdvancePayment()\n* Tax currency exchange (BG-X-41): new TaxCurrencyExchange property and SetTaxCurrencyExchange(); SetTaxTotalInAccountingCurrency() is obsolete\n* New Party.ElectronicAddress for all parties; SellerElectronicAddress/BuyerElectronicAddress are obsolete\n* New TradeLineItem.TotalAllowanceChargeAmount (BT-X-98) and SetReceivingAdviceReferencedDocument() overload with date (BT-15)\n* Complete item classification code list (BT-158-1), new SubjectCodes.OSI and ReferenceTypeCodes.AAK\n* Format detection now based on the XML root element; CII files with unknown guideline id are readable\n* Fixed BR-Z-10, electronic address in MINIMUM, empty IBAN, UBL price precision and BT-15 in UBL\n* InvoiceValidator: new checks for BR-CO-11 to BR-CO-17 and BR-DEC-20, fixed tax basis and due payable checks",
